<a class="node" href="#how" style="left:30%;top:22%"><span class="orb"><span aria-hidden="true">σ</span></span><span class="lbl">How I Work</span><span class="sub">σ signal and noise</span></a>
<a class="node" href="#experience" style="left:72%;top:30%"><span class="orb"><span aria-hidden="true">Δ</span></span><span class="lbl">Timeline</span><span class="sub">Δ change over time</span></a>
<a class="node" href="#work" style="left:52%;top:52%"><span class="orb"><span aria-hidden="true">β</span></span><span class="lbl">Case Studies</span><span class="sub">β what drives it</span></a>
<a class="node" href="#about" style="left:24%;top:68%"><span class="orb"><span aria-hidden="true">θ</span></span><span class="lbl">About</span><span class="sub">θ parameters</span></a>
<a class="node" href="#contact" style="left:76%;top:78%"><span class="orb"><span aria-hidden="true">λ</span></span><span class="lbl">Contact</span><span class="sub">λ rate</span></a>
</div>
<nav aria-label="Quick links">
<ul class="linklist">
<li class="eyebrow">Quick links</li>
<li><a href="#how"><span class="gl" aria-hidden="true">σ</span>How I Work</a></li>
<li><a href="#experience"><span class="gl" aria-hidden="true">Δ</span>Timeline</a></li>
<li><a href="#work"><span class="gl" aria-hidden="true">β</span>Case Studies</a></li>
<li><a href="#about"><span class="gl" aria-hidden="true">θ</span>About</a></li>
<li><a href="#contact"><span class="gl" aria-hidden="true">λ</span>Contact</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
</div>
</div>

<!-- services strip -->
<div class="svc" id="how">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">01 · Notice</span>
<h3>Find what repeats</h3>
<p>Seasons, cycles and outliers hide in plain sight. I look before I model.</p>
</div>
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">02 · Explain</span>
<h3>Ask how, then why</h3>
<p>A pattern is a clue, not an answer. I test what else could explain it, bias included.</p>
</div>
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">03 · Close the gap</span>
<h3>Turn it into a decision</h3>
<p>I show the finding, the uncertainty and the next step, so you can make an informed decision.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- 5. MODELS (blank for now) -->
<section class="sec" id="work">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="sec-h" style="margin-bottom:0">
<span class="eyebrow"><span class="gl" aria-hidden="true">β</span> &nbsp;Selected work</span>
<h2>Models and case studies</h2>
<p>Projects and case studies are on the way.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- 6. EXPERIENCE -->
<section class="sec" id="experience">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="work-top">
<div class="sec-h" style="margin-bottom:0">
<span class="eyebrow"><span class="gl" aria-hidden="true">Δ</span> &nbsp;Experience · change over time</span>
<h2>Timeline</h2>
</div>
<div class="pills" role="group" aria-label="Filter experience">
{['All', 'Analytics', 'GTM', 'Forecasting', 'AI', 'Education'].map((f) => (
<button class={f === 'All' ? 'pb on' : 'pb'} type="button" data-filter={f} aria-pressed={f === 'All' ? 'true' : 'false'}>{f}</button>
))}
</div>
</div>
<div class="tl">
{entries.map((e) => (
<div class="tl-item" data-cats={e.cats.join(' ')}>
<div class="tl-l">
<div class="logos">{e.logos.map((lg) => <img class="logo" src={lg} alt="" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />)}</div>
<span class="tl-d">{e.dates}</span><span class="tl-o">{e.org}</span>
</div>
<div class="tl-r">
<h3>{e.role}</h3>
<ul>{e.bullets.map((b) => <li>{b}</li>)}</ul>
<div class="row">{e.tags.map((tag) => <span class="chip">{tag}</span>)}</div>
</div>
</div>
))}
<p class="tl-empty" id="tl-empty" hidden>Nothing tagged here yet.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- 8. ABOUT -->
<section class="sec" id="about">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="about-grid">
<img class="photo" src="/images/sana.jpg" alt="Portrait of Sana Anwer" width="600" height="750" />
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">About</span>
<h2>Always learning. Always asking why.</h2>
<p>I am a Lead Go-To-Market Analyst at Tempo Software, working with go-to-market data in SaaS, and I am completing an MS in Analytics at Georgia Tech. I am based in the Greater Toronto Area.</p>
<p>My path into data started in banking operations, moved through fraud and anti-money-laundering work, and led to analytics roles in business and talent data. Earlier I was a research assistant in health research. I am a lifelong learner who builds skills through projects and case studies, and eventually I want to apply that work to health, law and public policy, studying the evidence without bias to help support change.</p>
<div class="now">
<span class="eyebrow">Now</span>
<span><b>Learning:</b> my MS Analytics coursework at Georgia Tech, and building my first case studies.</span>
</div>
<div class="beyond">
<span class="eyebrow">Beyond the data</span>
<div class="row">
<span class="chip">Psychological thrillers</span>
<span class="chip">Crime Junkie podcast</span>
<span class="chip">Travelling</span>
<span class="chip">Two cats</span>
</div>
<a class="love" href="https://www.gethalfbaked.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Something I love reading: Half Baked →</a>
<p class="hb">I enjoy the Half Baked newsletter because it scratches my innovation itch, people's ideas turning to real life products, what a thrill!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- 9. CLOSING CTA -->
<section id="contact">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="card closing">
<span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
<h2>Want to pick my brain?</h2>
<p>Curious about a dataset, a metric or a question you are stuck on? Send me a note and we can think it through together.</p>
<a class="btn btn-p" href="mailto:sana.s.anwer@gmail.com">Email me</a>
</div>

<footer class="foot">
<div class="foot-in">
<a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Back to top"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">Φ</span><span>Sana Anwer</span></a>
<div class="nav-r">
<a class="ib" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sana-anwer-gtm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn profile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg></a>
<a class="ib" href="https://github.com/sana-anwer-ds" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub profile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg></a>
<a class="ib" href="mailto:sana.s.anwer@gmail.com" aria-label="Email Sana"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg></a>
</div>
<small>© 2026 Sana Anwer</small>
</div>
</footer>
</div>
</section>

</main>
</Base>
<script>
  const root = document.documentElement;
  document.getElementById('theme-toggle')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const next = root.dataset.theme === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light';
    root.dataset.theme = next;
    try { localStorage.setItem('theme', next); } catch {}
  });

  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      btn.parentElement!.querySelectorAll('.pb').forEach((b) => {
        const on = b === btn;
        b.classList.toggle('on', on);
        b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(on));
      });
      const f = btn.dataset.filter!;
      let shown = 0;
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.tl-item').forEach((item) => {
        const ok = f === 'All' || (item.dataset.cats ?? '').split(' ').includes(f);
        item.hidden = !ok;
        if (ok) shown++;
      });
      document.getElementById('tl-empty')!.hidden = shown !== 0;
    });
  });
</script>
